    "description": "<br><div> <span style=\"font-family: verdana\"> <span style=\"font-size: 12px\">  </span> </span> \r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{52}\" paraid=\"411692883\"> About eTeam </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{58}\" paraid=\"2125402253\"> At eTeam, we are transforming the workforce solutions industry with agility, innovation, and technology. As a global leader in workforce, business, and digital transformation, we leverage AI-driven technologies and insights to connect top talent with leading companies. </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{72}\" paraid=\"488301418\"> Role Overview </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{78}\" paraid=\"731065460\"> As an Associate Recruiter, you will play a critical role in identifying, engaging, and placing top talent to drive business success. You will leverage AI-driven recruitment tools while maintaining a personal touch to ensure candidates find the right opportunities. Your focus will be on high-volume outreach, quality submissions, and rapid response times to maximize your success. </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{96}\" paraid=\"1209875175\"> Key Responsibilities </p> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"9\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{102}\" paraid=\"610895056\"> High-Impact Outreach: Proactively connect with potential candidates through calls, sourcing, and submissions. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"9\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{110}\" paraid=\"2132341166\"> Candidate Engagement: Respond to AI-generated interested candidates promptly (within one hour) to ensure seamless experience and maintain high efficiency and candidate engagement. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"9\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{138}\" paraid=\"2063377256\"> Pipeline Management: Build and maintain a strong talent pipeline, ensuring a steady flow of qualified candidates. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"9\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{146}\" paraid=\"1226166037\"> Performance & Results: Drive business growth by matching top talent with the right opportunities. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"9\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{154}\" paraid=\"1689660844\"> Collaboration & Compliance: Attend all calls booked by AI, follow best practices in talent acquisition, and contribute to an agile recruitment strategy. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"9\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{166}\" paraid=\"578468908\"> Brand Advocacy & Social Engagement: Actively engage on LinkedIn and other professional networks by sharing company updates, achievements, and insights. Share industry trends, hiring insights, and success stories to position eTeam as a leader in workforce, business, and digital transformation. Support recruitment and business efforts by commenting on, liking, and sharing eTeam posts. Encourage referrals and networking by promoting eTeam’s brand and open roles online. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{190}\" paraid=\"166933810\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{194}\" paraid=\"1721148764\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{198}\" paraid=\"1273522212\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{202}\" paraid=\"1872679040\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{206}\" paraid=\"242626046\"> Qualification & Competency Required: </p> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{214}\" paraid=\"1511148567\"> Self-motivated professionals who thrive in a fast-paced, high-performance environment. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{222}\" paraid=\"184412920\"> Strong communicators with excellent phone and relationship-building skills. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{230}\" paraid=\"1244394253\"> Tech-savvy recruiters comfortable using AI-driven technologies and recruitment platforms. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{242}\" paraid=\"320345111\"> Results-driven individuals who can adapt quickly and excel in a dynamic setting. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{93beedfe-0619-4bc2-a437-c3dd5d61739e}{250}\" paraid=\"1092192426\"> Hands-on experience working with MSP/VMS based Direct Clients or System Integrators. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{7}\" paraid=\"1990182395\"> Ability to Learn and be Coachable: Expected to be adaptable, open to feedback, and continuously improve their skills and knowledge. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{19}\" paraid=\"1055698178\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{23}\" paraid=\"1786454572\"> Strong Selling Skills: Must possess strong sales abilities, including the ability to present job opportunities persuasively to candidates. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{31}\" paraid=\"1035025555\"> Excellent Verbal and Written Communication Skills: The ability to effectively communicate job requirements, candidate qualifications, and service offerings with clarity, professionalism, and precision. This includes articulating information clearly and concisely, both in written and verbal formats, to internal teams, and candidates. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"10\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{39}\" paraid=\"703723475\"> Bachelor’s Degree in IT/Pharma is preferred, however combination of education and experience will also be considered. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{47}\" paraid=\"1061194180\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{51}\" paraid=\"1447373544\">  </p> \r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{55}\" paraid=\"2029275598\"> Why Join eTeam? </p> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"11\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{61}\" paraid=\"1321224675\"> Be part of a company shaping the future of work, business, and digital transformation. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"11\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{71}\" paraid=\"1105162903\"> Work with cutting-edge AI-driven technologies and insights that enhance efficiency and effectiveness. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-listid=\"11\" role=\"listitem\"> \r\n\t<p paraeid=\"{ddf0b182-bb14-4c98-97c1-1e14a8beeb10}{81}\" paraid=\"876338848\"> Experience a high-growth, performance-driven culture with clear career progression opportunities. </p> \r\n\t</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n\r\n<ul role=\"list\"> \r\n\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"multilevel\"}\" data-